    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tucked away behind a private entrance, this delightful two-bedroom townhouse is a true oasis in the heart of the town centre. The front door opens into a charming private courtyard, creating an immediate sense of peace and seclusion before leading into the house. \n\nPresented in good condition throughout, the property is filled with natural light and offers a wonderfully warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nA long, light-filled hallway leads to the comfortable living room, where French doors open directly onto the courtyard perfect for outdoor dining, morning coffee or quiet relaxation. \n\nThe kitchen is conveniently positioned off the living room. Further along the hallway are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both offering wardrobe storage, together with a bright bathroom featuring a Velux window. \nAn airing cupboard provides the added comfort of warm towels after a bath, while a separate utility room and gas-fired central heating add to the home`s everyday practicality.\n\nQuiet, private and quite magical, this hidden gem combines the tranquillity of a secluded retreat with the convenience of town-centre living. With shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities all within walking distance, it presents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a distinctive home with excellent potential. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the charm, privacy and unique atmosphere this special property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom town centre location </li><li> Private courtyard to front </li><li> Walking distance of all towns amenities </li><li> Both bedrooms have fitted wardrobes </li><li> Bathroom offers skylight and the airing cupboard for warm towels </li><li> Easy to maintain exterior courtyard - ideal for patio furniture & raised planters </li><li> Open plan living room / dining room with French doors to courtyard </li><li> Long bring hallway </li><li> Fully fitted small kitchen </li><li> Location - Location - Location</li></ul>"
      },
